$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Theta Draconis IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> On this abandoned world, the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle for possession of each flag. Daytime has now turned to night and the hovering bases of each team are even closer together for a more rapid a furious battle. Take out each solar panel to destroy all power to each base, then take down the enemy and grab the flag. This battle is super fast and the team who has the best teamwork will come out on top. Map done by LL Kunochi - drop me an email at gamedr@bellsouth.net";
